<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG has issued American-style call and put warrants of 10 million per series on the DAX Index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>The warrants mature between December 1997 and June 1998. Payment date is July 4, 1997 and they are listed on Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges. They are available in exercise lots of 100. --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
